            "title": "Netflix\u2019s $59 Billion Loan for Warner Bros. Among Biggest Ever",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Wells Fargo & Co., BNP Paribas SA and HSBC Plc are providing the unsecured bridge loan, according to a statement and filing on Friday.  Wells Fargo\u2019s $29.5 billion portion of the loan commitment represents the biggest by a single bank for an investment-grade bridge facility at a time when Wall Street is looking to earn lucrative fees tied to a long-awaited revival in acquisitions.  Such loans are a type of financing that is typically replaced with more permanent debt like corporate bonds.",
